      </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-4-2-2-3-3\">\n                                    71%\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"mt-5 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-line bg-[var(--surface-soft)] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 transition hover:border-purple-300 hover:bg-[var(--purple-wash)] dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-4-2-3\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-4-2-3-1\">\n                                View activity\n                            </span>\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-4-2-3-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"reveal reveal-delay-4 mt-5 grid gap-5 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.12fr)_minmax(0,.88fr)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5\">\n                    <div class=\"glass rounded-[22px] p-5 sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    Digital loyalty card\n                                </p>\n                                <h3 class=\"mt-1.5 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-[-.03em] text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1-1-2\">\n                                    A little progress goes a long way.\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Open loyalty card\" class=\"icon-button grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-[var(--surface-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1-2\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"external-link\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"loyalty-card relative mt-5 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] p-5 text-white sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2\">\n                            <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-[10px] border border-white/20 bg-white/15\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-amber-200\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"sparkles\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[-.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        Northstar Coffee\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-violet-100\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                                    Gold tier\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-violet-200/75\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        Maya Kim\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-violet-100/80\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        Member since Jan 2024\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-violet-200/75\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                        Balance\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                        1,840\n                                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-200\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                            pts\n                                        </span>\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3\">\n                                <div aria-label=\"8 of 10 stamps collected\" class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-3\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-3-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-4\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-4-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-5\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-5-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-6\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-6-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-7\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-7-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-filled\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-8\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-8-1\" data-lucide=\"check\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-empty\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-9\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"stamp is-empty\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-1-10\">\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-100\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-2-3-2\">\n                                    8 / 10 stamps\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-3\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-amber-500\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-3-1\" data-lucide=\"cake-slice\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-3-2\">\n                                2 visits to your free pastry\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-500/10 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-1-3-3\">\n                                Almost there\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"glass rounded-[22px] p-5 sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    Keep them coming back\n                                </p>\n                                <h3 class=\"mt-1.5 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-[-.03em] text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1-1-2\">\n                                    Top rewards\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1-2\">\n                                Manage\n                                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    →\n                                </span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 space-y-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-[var(--surface-soft)] px-3 py-3 transition hover:border-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1\">\n                                <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-500/15 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"cup-soda\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-2\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                        Free latte\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        Most popular this week\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-500/15 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-1-3\">\n                                    250 pts\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-[var(--surface-soft)] px-3 py-3 transition hover:border-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-500/15 dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-1-1\" data-lucide=\"croissant\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-2\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                        Pastry pair\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                                        Sweeten the next visit\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-500/15 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-2-3\">\n                                    400 pts\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-[var(--surface-soft)] px-3 py-3 transition hover:border-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3\">\n                                <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 dark:bg-indigo-500/15 dark:text-indigo-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-1-1\" data-lucide=\"coffee\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-2\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-ink\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-2-1\">\n                                        Coffee flight\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-2-2\">\n                                        Try something new\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-500/15 dark:text-amber-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-5-2-2-3-3\">\n                                    650 pts\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <footer class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-line pt-4 text-[11px] font-semibold text-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-6\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-6-1\">\n                        Perkly for Northstar Coffee\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-6-2\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-6-2-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Last synced 2 min ago\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    const app = document.getElementById('perkly-app');\n  if (window.lucide) window.lucide.createIcons();\n\n  const themeToggle = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');\n  themeToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const dark = app.dataset.theme === 'dark';\n    app.dataset.theme = dark ? 'light' : 'dark';\n    themeToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', dark ? 'Switch to dark mode' : 'Switch to light mode');\n  });\n\n  const mobileNav = document.getElementById('mobile-nav');\n  mobileNav.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = app.dataset.mobileOpen === 'true';\n    app.dataset.mobileOpen = open ? 'false' : 'true';\n    mobileNav.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!open));\n    mobileNav.setAttribute('aria-label', open ? 'Open navigation' : 'Close navigation');\n  });\n\n  const chartData = {\n    '7D': {\n      total: '3,421',\n      caption: '12.8% more activity than the previous period',\n      line: 'M0 198 C44 190 60 164 106 174 C154 185 166 138 214 151 C258 163 281 118 323 127 C367 137 386 104 430 113 C478 124 493 72 540 90 C590 108 603 54 652 66 C680 73 701 38 720 44',\n      area: 'M0 198 C44 190 60 164 106 174 C154 185 166 138 214 151 C258 163 281 118 323 127 C367 137 386 104 430 113 C478 124 493 72 540 90 C590 108 603 54 652 66 C680 73 701 38 720 44 L720 260 L0 260 Z'\n    },\n    '30D': {\n      total: '14,806',\n      caption: '18.6% more activity than the previous period',\n      line: 'M0 210 C45 204 67 187 112 192 C158 198 176 152 220 164 C269 176 289 133 334 143 C378 153 404 119 446 129 C492 141 513 91 556 106 C602 120 621 77 664 84 C691 88 706 62 720 69',\n      area: 'M0 210 C45 204 67 187 112 192 C158 198 176 152 220 164 C269 176 289 133 334 143 C378 153 404 119 446 129 C492 141 513 91 556 106 C602 120 621 77 664 84 C691 88 706 62 720 69 L720 260 L0 260 Z'\n    },\n    '90D': {\n      total: '42,530',\n      caption: '24.1% more activity than the previous period',\n      line: 'M0 222 C42 212 63 198 108 205 C149 212 176 177 218 184 C266 192 288 143 331 158 C375 173 400 132 441 143 C484 155 513 106 555 118 C599 130 621 86 661 96 C688 103 706 72 720 77',\n      area: 'M0 222 C42 212 63 198 108 205 C149 212 176 177 218 184 C266 192 288 143 331 158 C375 173 400 132 441 143 C484 155 513 106 555 118 C599 130 621 86 661 96 C688 103 706 72 720 77 L720 260 L0 260 Z'\n    }\n  };\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-range]').forEach((button) => {\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const range = button.dataset.range;\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-range]').forEach((item) => {\n        const active = item === button;\n        item.dataset.active = String(active);\n        item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));\n      });\n      document.getElementById('chart-total').textContent = chartData[range].total;\n      document.getElementById('chart-caption').textContent = chartData[range].caption;\n      document.getElementById('chart-line').setAttribute('d', chartData[range].line);\n      document.getElementById('chart-area').setAttribute('d', chartData[range].area);\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n<style>\n    @keyframes perkly-wave { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 22% { transform: rotate(15deg); } 44% { transform: rotate(-9deg); } 66% { transform: rotate(5deg); } }\n</style>\n",
